      "statement": "Dcode gives each synchronous declarative child its own CLI middleware stack, including nested cost tracking, truncation handling, retry, hooks and applicable approval, MCP, skill-only disclosure, memory-guard, shell-policy, and provider-search layers; setting an empty child `interrupt_on` prevents duplicate inherited SDK HITL, while remote async specs are not locally rewritten.",
