      "statement": "With an explicit `--allow-fs-tools` list, dcode replaces the main filesystem middleware and injects an equivalent restriction into every synchronous declarative child; it refuses compiled subagents rather than silently bypassing the restriction, and leaves remote async agents to their own backend.",
